      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name}\n\nHello. \n\nThe steps I can use to reproduce this issue are as follows:\n\n* using SDK v3.8.2.\n\n* using the following free avatar:\n\nhttps://booth.pm/ja/items/3818504\n\n* This can also be reproduced with the following avatar:\n\nhttps://ponderogen.booth.pm/items/6106863\n\n1. Create and open a new avatar project from VCC\n\n2. Import the avatar's unitypackage\n\n3. Add the avatar's Phys_Haolan prefab to the scene\n\n4. Duplicate Phys_Haolan 30 times in the Hierarchy\n\n5. Create Empty in the Hierarchy and move all Phys_Haolan objects into it\n\n6. Open VRChat SDK and alternately switch between the Authentication tab and Builder tab\n\n7. Scheduler.Tick appears\n\nIf you skip step 5, the symptom does not occur.\n\nI've uploaded a video for reference below:\n\nhttps://x.com/tama_vrc/status/1941713837096624632\n\nThanks.",
